course: dictionary
lesson: 14386
title: Ornamental: made to look nice
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some things are made to be useful, like a spoon or a coat. Other things are made just to look beautiful. Ornamental is the word for that. It means used to decorate something and make it look nice, rather than for a practical job.
explain: «The gardener planted ornamental flowers along the path.» The flowers are not there to feed anyone or to keep the rain out. They are there to look lovely. Ask yourself: is this thing for a job, or for beauty? If it is for beauty, the word is probably ornamental.
explain: Ornamental is used for gardens, ponds, fish and carvings on old buildings. «The church had ornamental carvings around the door.» The carvings are decoration. They make the door look special, but they are not what keeps the door shut.
fact: Ornamental is an adjective, a word that describes a noun.
fact: «Ornamental» means used to decorate and make something look nice, not for a practical use.
fact: «Ornamental plants» are grown in gardens to be pretty.
fact: «Ornamental fish» are kept in ponds or tanks because they are beautiful to watch.
exercise: «The garden had ornamental ponds with golden fish.» What does ornamental mean here? | *Used to decorate and look nice | Used for drinking water | Deep enough for swimming | Built to keep out floods
exercise: Which of these is most likely to be ornamental? | A spade for digging | A kettle for boiling water | *A carved stone bird on a garden wall | A bucket for carrying water
exercise: Which word in «The ornamental plants made the garden bright» tells you the plants are there for looks? | plants | garden | *ornamental | bright
test: A farmer grows wheat to sell as food. Is the wheat ornamental? | *No, it is grown for a practical use: food | Yes, it is grown to look pretty
test: «The palace had ornamental gates made of gold.» Which is the best meaning of ornamental? | Cheap and plain | Old and falling apart | Strong, made to keep people out | *Decorative, made to look beautiful
exam: Which is the best reason a brick wall is not ornamental? | It is made of gold | It has a nice view over the hills | *It is built to keep people and animals out, a practical job | It is painted bright pink to look nice
